# Layout ladder, step 7 (plan/20-core-domain/29-layout-ladder.md): the distribution header's ring
# with one injection branch -- the source HS1 and the AHU circuit of m2-distribution-header, the
# second branch and its header taps (N4, N6) left out. HS1 states `out` only: with one load the
# closed-circuit balance sizes its power.

fluidscript 1
project static plant_01

circuit heating 100
fluid water

HS1     heat_exchanger out=60

connections
N1 - HS1 - N3
N5 - N1

N1 node p=250

circuit AHU 101

HE_AHU  load in=50 out=30 power=24 kW
TV_AHU  three_way_valve
PU_AHU  pump
PA1     pipe length=12 dn=25
PA2     pipe length=12 dn=25

connections
N3 - PA1 - TV_AHU.a
NM_AHU - TV_AHU.b
TV_AHU.ab - PU_AHU - HE_AHU - NM_AHU
NM_AHU - PA2 - N5
